# Aegis fix catalog #002 — Duplicate key in a YAML mapping
#
# Tier:       1 · Simple
# Category:   duplicate_config_key (auto-diagnosed from the log below)
# Engine:     deterministic rule engine — no AI involved
#
# CI log:
#   | Invalid workflow file: .github/workflows/ci.yml#L18
#   | duplicate mapping key "runs-on"
#
# How it is solved:
#   MODIFY .github/workflows/ci.yml
#     - Removed duplicate YAML keys — GitHub Actions and most YAML parsers reject a mapping that repeats a key
#     - the first occurrence is kept and the duplicate is commented out
#
# Apply:      git apply 01-simple/002-duplicate_config_key.diff
diff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml
--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml
